horsefollow.command.help.title=[HorseFollow] Commands:
horsefollow.command.help.bind=/horsefollow bind - It binds the horse you are riding.
horsefollow.command.help.unbind=/horsefollow unbind - Break the bond with your mount.
horsefollow.command.help.status=/horsefollow status - Shows if you have a bound horse.
horsefollow.command.help.distance=/horsefollow distance <value> - Defines the teleport distance (in blocks). Use 0 to disable.
horsefollow.command.help.call=/horsefollow call - Call the horse over to you.
horsefollow.command.help.reload=/horsefollow reload - Reloads the mod to apply distance and/or language updates.
